    "caption": "A foster donated this cat tree, and after some repairs it's going to a mama cat and her seven kittens we brought in off the street. 💜\nUsed or a little broken? Donate it anyway. We sanitize, repair, and upgrade what we can, and most supplies go back out the same day.\nWe pick up cat, dog, and bunny supplies on our routes through , , and . Call .",
